      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T18:22:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think you need to mention Servo V4 here - if people have the servo they are likely to run servod anyways.\n\nThe appeal of this alternative is that no additional hardware is required.",
