    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "69cdd982_0f309a07",
        "filename": "util/iteflash.md",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 82,
      "author": {
        "id": 1291807
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T18:36:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should work the same with CCD via Servo v4 or SuzyQ, I don\u0027t see a reason to exclude Servo v4 from this section.\n\nYes some Servo v4 functionality that SuzyQ doesn\u0027t have is best controlled via servod (e.g. PD power on/off), but none of that is relevant here.\n\nI find Servo v4 more convenient for CCD because it can handle either cable orientation, and because it can supply power.  Neither of those things requires running servod.",
      "parentUuid": "f0421e4b_3f182d31",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 48,
        "endLine": 82,
        "endChar": 110
      },
      "revId": "a1192c64ae04c1e2e6de67d647e10dd6191bb0c5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1ea918f9_4e80f3f8",
        "filename": "util/iteflash.md",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 82,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T18:39:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this document meant to be read only by partners?\n\nI am thinking about a hobbyist who does not have any servo but wants to be able to update the device firmware. The iteflash utility provides this ability, I think it would be beneficial to emphasize it in this document.\n\nIn fact this goes for all partners too: if they want to run FAFT - yes, they need servos and servod. If they just want to change ap/ec firmware - they don\u0027t need any of that, just SuzyQ. They don\u0027t even need the chroot. I think we should make this clearer, but not necessarily in this document.",
      "parentUuid": "abada6a4_a5f6fceb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 48,
        "endLine": 82,
        "endChar": 110
      },
      "revId": "a1192c64ae04c1e2e6de67d647e10dd6191bb0c5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "aa48bcb8_3d4ece77",
        "filename": "util/iteflash.md",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 82,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T18:44:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, servo v4 makes it easier, but it is some piece of hardware a hobbyist is very unlikely to have.\n\nI really don\u0027t understand your guys reluctance to make this mode of operation more visible, it is by far preferable by people in the open software community who we (Chrome OS) are trying to cater to.\n\nBut I\u0027ll leave this to your discretion.",
      "parentUuid": "1ea918f9_4e80f3f8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 48,
        "endLine": 82,
        "endChar": 110
      },
      "revId": "a1192c64ae04c1e2e6de67d647e10dd6191bb0c5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bacf6e82_29e61fad",
        "filename": "util/iteflash.md",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 82,
      "author": {
        "id": 1291807
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T19:56:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The primary audience for this doc is CrOS engineers, followed by CrOS partners.  I say CrOS engineers first because to my knowledge, most EC firmware development is done within CrOS org.\n\nHobbyist support is definitely secondary (or tertiary).  I accommodated hobbyists by:\n\n1) Making this doc public\n2) Linking directly to a place to purchase SuzyQ\n3) Including lots of links to public CrOS ecosystem docs for context\n\nHowever I am not going to restructure the doc for the hobbyist case.",
      "parentUuid": "aa48bcb8_3d4ece77",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 48,
        "endLine": 82,
        "endChar": 110
      },
      "revId": "a1192c64ae04c1e2e6de67d647e10dd6191bb0c5",
