      "message": "sounds great and I am not suggesting restructuring, but mentioning clearly that ITE EC can be programmed without any servo board and the need to create chroot and run servod would sure make a lot of difference helpful.\n\nI am planning to publish a doc describing how one can reprogram chrome OS ap and ec firmware without any servos, servods or even chroot. I\u0027ll mention it here once it is available.",
